sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer as PER-001 (Customer)
    participant Channel as SVC-017<br/>Digital Channels
    participant IAM as SVC-100<br/>IAM
    participant Compliance as SVC-015<br/>Compliance Core
    participant KYC as SVC-014<br/>KYC/AML
    participant EventBus as SVC-102<br/>Event Bus
    participant Retail as SVC-001<br/>Retail Banking Core
    participant Notifications as SVC-053<br/>Notifications
    participant Audit as SVC-103<br/>Audit & Logging

    Note over Customer,Audit: PH-119 — SAR Submission and Identity Verification

    Customer->>Channel: Submit SAR via online banking portal + complete SCA
    Channel->>IAM: POST /sca/validate {assertion}
    IAM-->>Channel: {valid: true}
    Channel->>Compliance: POST /sar {sca_assertion_ref}
    Note right of Compliance: Create SarCase (status=received)<br/>deadline_date = today + 30 days
    Compliance->>EventBus: Publish SarCaseOpened (EVT-159)
    EventBus->>Notifications: Consume EVT-159 → Send acknowledgement: case ref, 30-day deadline
    EventBus->>Audit: Consume EVT-159 → Write immutable SAR receipt record
    Compliance-->>Channel: 201 Created {sar_case_id, deadline_date}
    Channel-->>Customer: Display SAR confirmation: case reference, deadline

    Note over Customer,Audit: PH-120 — Data Extraction and Compilation

    EventBus->>KYC: Consume EVT-159 → Extract KYC/AML records (intra-CAP-005)
    KYC->>Compliance: Return KYC data extract (intra-capability)
    EventBus->>Retail: Consume EVT-159 → Extract account data and transaction history
    Retail->>EventBus: Publish SarDataExtractReady (internal) → data to SVC-015
    Note right of Compliance: Compile full data pack<br/>Update SarCase status=under_review

    Note over Customer,Audit: PH-121 — Legal Review and Redaction

    Note right of Compliance: DPO review; apply Schedule 2 exemptions<br/>Redact third-party data; generate encrypted PDF<br/>Update SarCase status=response_ready

    Note over Customer,Audit: PH-122 — Response Delivery and Case Closure

    Compliance->>EventBus: Publish SarCaseClosed (EVT-160)
    EventBus->>Channel: Consume EVT-160 → Make download link available in portal
    EventBus->>Notifications: Consume EVT-160 → Send response ready notification with secure link
    EventBus->>Audit: Consume EVT-160 → Write immutable closure record (days_to_close)
    Customer->>Channel: Download encrypted response pack via secure link
    Channel-->>Customer: Deliver encrypted PDF response pack (within 30-day deadline)
